        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════
     WHY YOU NEED A WEBSITE
══════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section why">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <p class="section-label">Why it matters</p>
    <h2 class="section-title">Your competitors have one.<br>Your customers expect one.</h2>
    <p class="section-body">A Facebook page is not a website. And Google ranks real websites higher than social profiles.</p>
    <div class="why-stats">
      <div>
        <div class="why-stat-value">76%</div>
        <div class="why-stat-label">of consumers research online before buying</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="why-stat-value">67%</div>
        <div class="why-stat-label">more leads for businesses with a website</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="why-stat-value">8×</div>
        <div class="why-stat-label">higher failure rate without a website</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="why-points">
      <div class="why-point">
        <h3>Trust</h3>
        <p>Potential clients are 76% more likely to buy from a business with a professional website. No website means no trust.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-point">
        <h3>Google Rankings</h3>
        <p>Google ranks websites higher than social profiles. If you don't have a site, your competitors are taking your spots.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-point">
        <h3>24/7 Salesperson</h3>
        <p>Your website works while you sleep. Captures leads, answers questions, and books jobs — even at 2am.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="why-cta">
      <a href="#apply" class="btn-on-dark">Apply for your website →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

